# Goal: where we want the robot arm's end-effector to move (in meters)
float64 target_x
float64 target_y
float64 target_z
---
# Result: final summary returned once the move succeeds or is canceled
bool success
string message
float64 final_distance_m
---
# Feedback: live progress updates streamed continuously while moving
float64 distance_remaining_m
float64 progress_pct
